        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Leslie Phillips, Paul McCartney, Ray Galton, Alan Simpson\n- Works: Some Will, Some Won't, Get Well Soon, A Hard Day's Night\n- Roles: Henry Russell, Paul McCartney's grandfather\n\nFacts:\n- Leslie Phillips played Henry Russell in the film \"Some Will, Some Won't\".\n- The TV series \"Get Well Soon\" depicted the real-life meeting of writers Ray Galton and Alan Simpson.\n- Ray Galton and Alan Simpson wrote the film \"Some Will, Some Won't\".\n- Leslie Phillips also played Paul McCartney's grandfather in the film \"A Hard Day's Night\".",
