        "original_id": "7001f472-6978-5d34-9765-ddf61ead4ee1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wilfrid Brambell, Harry H. Corbett, Paul McCartney, Ray Galton, Alan Simpson\n- Works: Steptoe and Son Ride Again, A Hard Day's Night, Some Will, Some Won't, Get Well Soon, Steptoe and Son\n- Roles: Henry Russell\n- Events: Ray Galton and Alan Simpson meeting in a Tuberculosis sanatorium\n\nFacts:\n- In 1947, Ray Galton and Alan Simpson met in a Tuberculosis sanatorium, and Get Well Soon was based on that meeting.\n- Wilfrid Brambell performed alongside the Beatles in A Hard Day's Night and played Paul McCartney's fictional grandfather.\n- Some Will, Some Won't featured a cameo by Steptoe and Son actor Wilfrid Brambell as Henry Russell, who left four family members £150,000 in his will on the condition that they complete bizarre tasks.\n- Steptoe and Son Ride Again again starred Wilfrid Brambell and Harry H. Corbett.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
